WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:08.091
[jazzy standard music]

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.677
- ♪ WOULD YOU
LOOK AT THE TIME? ♪

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.554
- ♪ YOU SHOULD JUST
STAY HERE TONIGHT ♪

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.932
- ♪ I'VE HAD TOO MUCH WINE ♪

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.558
- ♪ YOU WILL LEAVE
AT FIRST LIGHT ♪

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.727
- ♪ IT ISN'T THAT FAR ♪

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.020
- ♪ BABY,
JUST STAY WHERE YOU ARE ♪

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.897
- ♪ BACK TO MY PLACE ♪

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:25.067
- ♪ YOU CAN'T ESCAPE
FROM MY EMBRACE ♪

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.027
- ♪ I REALLY
HAD A VERY NICE TIME ♪

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.071
- ♪ LET ME JUST
REFILL THAT WINE ♪

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:31.323
- ♪ BUT I REALLY NEED TO
JUST SAY GOOD-BYE ♪

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:33.033
- ♪ I WOULD LOVE
TO SEE YOU TRY ♪

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.035
- ♪ PLEASE UNLOCK
THIS DOOR ♪

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.120
- ♪ IT'S LOCKED
FROM THE OUTSIDE ♪

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.791
♪ BABE, YOU'RE MINE TONIGHT ♪
- ♪ I CANNOT STAY TONIGHT ♪

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.709
♪ LOOK, I REALLY HAVE TO GO ♪

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.503
- ♪ NO, YOU REALLY
HAVE TO STAY ♪

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:46.588
- ♪ HEY, "NO" MEANS NO ♪

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.757
- ♪ THAT IS WHAT
THEY ALL SAY ♪

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:50.634
- ♪ YOU'RE HURTING MY ARM ♪

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.177
- ♪ I WON'T CAUSE YOU
ANY HARM ♪

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.054
- ♪ LET GO OF ME ♪

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.807
- ♪ WE CAN MAKE THIS HARD
OR JUST EASY ♪

00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:59.476
- ♪ A WOMAN ALWAYS
COMES PREPARED ♪

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.311
- ♪ OOH, I'M REALLY SCARED ♪

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:03.063
- ♪ I SAID THIS IS
NOT WHAT I WANT ♪

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.648
- ♪ WHY YOU HAVE TO
BE SUCH A-- ♪

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:06.692
- ♪ I KNOW SELF-DEFENSE ♪

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:08.694
- ♪ I DARE YOU TO TRY IT ♪

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:11.154
- ♪ I DON'T WANT TO FIGHT ♪

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:15.826
- ♪ BITCH,
YOU ARE MINE TONIGHT ♪

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:23.166
♪ ♪

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.216
♪ PLEASE,
JUST PLEASE GO AWAY ♪

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.427
- ♪ I THOUGHT THAT YOU
WANTED ME TO STAY ♪

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:35.304
- ♪ WELL--WELL,
I JUST CHANGED MY MIND ♪

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:37.639
- ♪ THINK I'LL JUST
STAY AND UNWIND ♪

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:40.017
- ♪ HOW DID THIS ALL SWITCH? ♪

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:42.811
- ♪ NOW YOU ARE... ♪

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.730
♪ MY... ♪

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.481
♪ BITCH ♪

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:47.899
- ♪ PLEASE JUST
BE KIND TONIGHT! ♪

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.569
- ♪ NOW YOU'RE MINE... ♪

00:01:50.569 --> 00:01:52.696
♪ TO... ♪

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:57.200
♪ NIGHT ♪

